  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是全部了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的貴族",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "絕無一絲隱瞞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種處理方式......倒也有些出乎意料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的貴族",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼辦？不怎麼辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這件事本來就和你無關，現在不過是改了改對涉事領地的處置，能和你扯上任何關係嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的貴族",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說得是。可這樣一來，那些感染者得以繼續在那個地塊上生活，難保他們不亂說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那又如何？誰會相信一群感染者的胡言亂語？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的貴族",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我們接下來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不必著急，該做的事情還有很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恭謹的侍從",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......以上就是這次事件的最終報告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_487_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "辛苦你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_487_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個叫車爾尼的，他在這次事件中作的那首曲子，你們找來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恭謹的侍從",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_487_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女皇之聲隨時可以採譜，幾小時後就能為您演奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_487_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不必，我聽錄音就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_487_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_487_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不錯，我甚至能聽見他作曲時發自心底的吼聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_487_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這人很有些才華，可惜，還不太夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "結果怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還行，沒加重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行板說，那次事件導致的感染加重很奇特，許多人的感染在那之後都進入了持續的穩定期，我也不例外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會是像之前那樣先好後壞吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按行板的說法，他們徹底調查了這一現象，發現在事件中活性化的源石，幾乎全部進入了持續的低活性狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "換句話說，我還能晃悠一陣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，行板知道公爵大人打算拿夕照區怎麼辦嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她也是聽說的，說是女皇之聲要求公爵大人不能動夕照區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝天謝地！感謝女皇陛下的仁慈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小點聲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，這以後的日子該怎麼過啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "閉嘴吧，你還嫌事情不夠大是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以後的日子？過一天算一天罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_496_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我還想多活兩天呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頹廢的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你就更該把嘴閉嚴實了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉，我現在算是理解了，有些事還是不知道比較輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等處理完這裡的後續工作，我還是申請調動到其他地方好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者去本艦上看看，應該也不錯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "站住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了找你，我們也費了不少功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什麼想說的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是你的人騙白堊來維謝海姆的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了音樂會的報酬之外，告訴他的全是真話，就為了把急著賺錢給我治病的他引到這個局裡來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是他和你無冤無仇，你為什麼這麼做？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是聽了內情，我就不能放你走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本來也沒幾天好活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行吧，看在我們倆共事過的份上，我告訴你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯特羅洛伯爵已經在找白堊了，而且快找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那又怎樣？白堊一直在我身邊，也就等於一直在你的掌控之下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看到過她的研究筆記，你應該知道，她對塵世之音的研究確實很令人驚訝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在沒拿到那些筆記之前，我只知道她對這東西研究很深，卻不知道深到了什麼程度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我害怕的是，如果讓她接著研究下去，她沒准能用塵世之音幹出些更恐怖的事來，比如在更遠的距離引發和誘導共振。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一覺醒來，身邊的好孫子變成了怪物，這就是你想要的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "與其這樣，還不如直接把白堊塞到她鼻子底下，讓她覺得時不我待，在技術尚有瑕疵的時候推進計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼樣，還有疑問嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果黑鍵他們沒發現夕照廳裡的擴音器，你怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......還能怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夕照區什麼樣，我就什麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我沒什麼好問的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就跟我走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不殺我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殺了你既沒必要，又傷感情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，去我的店裡喝杯咖啡，我們一起聊一聊那兩個愚蠢又可敬的年輕人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_495_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能拒絕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你覺得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小炎熔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "誰讓你逞能的？你要是出了什麼意外，我一輩子都不會原諒你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，你是說維謝海姆的事？我這不是好好的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "是誰和一幫聽信了謠言的人對峙，是誰明知道自己會受塵世之音影響還不撤離，是誰連法術都沒怎麼學過就和人以命相搏的啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得我沒給你講過這些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我去找過車爾尼先生了！他告訴我的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......如果你想知道事情經過，直接來問我不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我其實是想問問那位在萊塔尼亞教過我鋼琴的約翰老師的事，和車爾尼先生聊起來才知道，你差點——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "差點就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——我警告你！下次再有這種事，你絕對不許逞能！你......你聽見了嗎，聽見了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別哭啦，我這不是好好的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "可你的感染程度——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實因為塵世之音加深了不少，但已經控制住了，所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "不行，控制住也不行！你總是讓我注意身體，可是到了自己身上，就什麼都不管了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你要是......不在了，我、我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小炎熔，姐姐保證，一定會更加留心保護自己的，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你可不許騙我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼會呢。博士給我批的假期還挺長的，我會好好利用這段時間休養一下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦，你不是去問那位約翰老師的情況了嗎？他怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "車爾尼先生說，他一年前在一個交流會上見過約翰老師一次，約翰老師一切都好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "這麼一說，你好不容易去了一趟萊塔尼亞，連法杖都換成了笛子，難道你也在那裡學了音樂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我最多也就是當法杖在用罷了，不會吹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "該不會，你其實在害羞吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這有什麼好害羞的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我不信！你吹來聽聽嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那......我真的吹了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "難聽死啦！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多謝您的關心，博士。我現在感覺很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且我要再次感謝您對夕照區的保護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有您代表羅德島去交涉，女皇之聲是無論如何也不會為一個小小的夕照區發話的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這是我應該做的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "車爾尼",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "您客氣了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "幫助感染者是羅德島的宗旨。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "車爾尼",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "如您所說，我最近更加深刻地感受到了這一點。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "和黑鍵相比，夕照區的事算是容易的了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "車爾尼",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "......"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "您找我到這裡來所為何事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "您提交報告申請去前線，我來確認您的意向。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我的想法已經完整地寫在報告裡了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "雖然您的病情目前穩定，但感染程度很深。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "戰場上一切皆有可能。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我有心理準備。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，在被芙蓉攙著去音樂廳的時候，我已經做好赴死的準備了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "雖然出了這麼多波折，事件的結果也和我天真的預想大相徑庭，但我卻......活下來了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這種感覺實在是有些奇妙，我卻無法很好地表達出來，無論透過話語還是音樂都不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不奢求在戰場上找到將其表達出來的方法，但我想，用一種完全不同的方式為感染者奮鬥，也許對我更有好處。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我明白您的心情。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不過，還請您安心等待審批的結果。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "說起來，黑鍵是在羅德島上吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "當然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "您為什麼問這個？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "從來到羅德島的第二天開始，我就完全見不到他了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我偶爾甚至會覺得，好像那個一身黑衣服的烏提卡伯爵真的死了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "按照萊塔尼亞的官方口徑，他確實已經死了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他活得好好的，給他一些時間吧。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "諷刺的是，這反倒助成了我們和萊塔尼亞的合作。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......您說得對。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那麼，我先走了，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "說到黑鍵，我要做的下一件事，恰好和他相關。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "您要見見他嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不必了。這件事對他的傷害之大，我甚至不敢說自己能理解，也只能想像了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等他什麼時候願意見我或芙蓉了，那時候再說吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "車爾尼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "再見，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "再見。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "期待您在戰鬥之餘創作出不輸以往的音樂。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士？虧你能找到我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這裡很適合吹風。很減壓。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "黑鍵",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "我沒什麼壓力可減。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "黑鍵",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "和我無話可說？"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "有幹員在這裡見過你。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "黑鍵",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "哪位？我不介意和他聊聊。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "言歸正傳，我來充當一回信使。這是你的信。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "信？從哪寄來的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "萊塔尼亞。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道是什麼了，把信給我吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "需要陪拆服務嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你還挺有趣的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "過獎。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "很難想像你指揮作戰的時候是什麼樣的......也像現在這樣不正經？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "哈哈。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "黑鍵",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "這是你感到尷尬時的標準反應？"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "黑鍵",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "一個戴著兜帽、一言不發的人，嘖嘖嘖，還挺恐怖。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我不介意在你出任務的時候更不正經一些。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "黑鍵",
              "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "那還挺讓人期待的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我走了。繼續享受獨處時光吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不用你說我也會的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這是......萊塔尼亞平民黑鍵的護照。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "白堊的......還有烏提卡伯爵的......死亡證明。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯？還有什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......信？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沒簽名......匿名信？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑鍵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "很符合我對她的印象。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "羅德島幹員黑鍵把杖尖抵在信上，紙張燃燒起來。\n火苗很快蔓延到護照上，然後是烏提卡伯爵的死亡證明，然後是白堊的。\n紙張燃燒的味道在甲板上蔓延開來。\n黑鍵抱起立在一旁的大提琴。\n心中想著某位朋友拉琴時的樣子，他閉著眼，奏出一段簡單明快的旋律。\n雙子女皇剛剛掌權時，萊塔尼亞湧現出無數歌功頌德的歌曲，這也是其中一首。\n時至今日，這首歌的後半段早已被人忘卻，只有前半部分，因其明朗的旋律和直白抒發自己愉快心情的歌詞，還在一些人口中傳唱。\n夕陽刺眼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
